      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10974/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a greased 10 x 15 inch pan, place the corn chips.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dfctPJjog6bkAzPq4SR9u_ycJ4I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-10974-funky-frito-fruckies-VAT-step-02-e68db0f85b474477a762a80965f7a5e1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10974/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan, bring the sugar and corn syrup to a boil over medium heat. Remove from heat and stir in the peanut butter until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vBifofHGYicr0NebApg3tNrj1Lo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-10974-funky-frito-fruckies-VAT-step-03-005d6f87f0964b51b5a5cfc00a825bb1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10974/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the mixture over the chips and smooth level.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/97fHisGAeZGaa-TsCSpSQ_CEBtY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-10974-funky-frito-fruckies-VAT-step-04-bbb0e0d6d608448db88272b1121a14bd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10974/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the chocolate bars in a single layer over the hot mixture and wait a few minutes until the heat melts them and then smooth the chocolate out to form a thin layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xNP_5ftHgulQT8ZTQcGXk8nZGV0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-10974-funky-frito-fruckies-VAT-step-05-e9c65a857a8c4f98a423e782d919a426.jpg"
