    "description": "This salty and sweet recipe will put your leftover Halloween chocolate to good use! In this video, Nicole shows you how to make funky Frito fruckies with a creamy peanut butter sauce. After preparing the sugary peanut butter sauce over the stove, pour it over a pan of Frito chips. Finally, place individual pieces of chocolate over the hot peanut butter mixture and allow them to melt before smoothing the chocolate out. Once the chips have cooled and solidified, enjoy this easily-made, crowd pleasing snack!",
